{"version":1,"key":"card:276","content":{"id":276,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6f3fd08a-437c-432f-b707-ead435be2e3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 不同于 Java、C++ 等典型的面向对象语言，JavaScript 在过去并没有类的概念，所以一些从 Java 或 C++ 等其他面向语言转过来的开发者会感到困惑，所以在 ES6 中引入了类的概念。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"db3d93f0-9cdf-43e4-83e7-b37374b6e755","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用关键字 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"class"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明一个类"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"22f288f8-966b-4b3c-901c-ff5fb06f03df","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"eac6e40b-63f9-441d-b016-c20ac7dc3dd5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Person {\n  constructor(name) {\n    this.name = name;\n  }\n\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(`Hello ${this.name}`);\n  }\n}\n\nconst amy = new Person(\"Amy\");\namy.sayHello(); // Hello Amy","collabId":"75fc376e-4457-453a-88ff-29ad46bbac19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d1eec006-9414-4319-9fff-fcf19af9d180","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要注意的是 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"text":"class"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":" 只是一种语法糖，即一个 "},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"code":true,"highlight":true,"text":"class"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"highlight":true,"text":" 其实本质上就是一个函数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"6189d6df-d857-4eaf-b44b-aa57d4f0eb92","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ce321aa9-a6e3-4c90-a737-1f599c5bbb1b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Person {\n  // ...\n}\n\nconsole.log(typeof Person); // function","collabId":"f284d388-f57c-4747-98f2-243eaca547d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"fe0b467f-46bf-4347-8bb8-1ecd7384d9d0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类与构造函数有如下不同："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"a712144a-e6c8-488e-9672-31816be56ea9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"fb99551b-ab03-47ae-a311-527e7f6c5586","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c06c0d8b-066c-46e7-b07b-5363d19fef0e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类的声明不会提升到作用域的顶部"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"53f46919-13f4-44ce-9cbe-833eb26b1f8d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"37afe932-4937-4c19-8ec5-856f1faec9cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在类内部的代码自动运行在严格模式 (strict mode) 之下"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"aeb197e8-ff99-438a-912f-8e585c83e2ef","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9da4678b-b0c8-4125-a868-cbe380122170","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类中的方法都是不可枚举的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9ae092e1-954b-4061-af5c-3da083d30c41","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3de3cd0b-d5ee-40e5-a11a-ec674380ce81","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类中的方法都没有内置的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"[[Construct]]"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，所以当你 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一个类内部的方法时，会抛出错误"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4b3a1786-4e3f-4051-ae98-95d1c98b9bb3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1e725d26-8c21-4ad4-9061-519e0e92da26","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"new"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 调用类会发生错误"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"200b18eb-88b2-4ac7-8c9f-9dea034a4f31","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4fa587e0-2874-4533-a846-e35cf1d5b742","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在类中的方法中不能修改类名"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"5b68a1f5-367f-41ec-a039-a7ec539b67ee","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3b13cce4-5af7-4b1b-9a82-3fc4bbc1f674","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"class Person {\n  contructor() {\n    // 不能在方法中修改类名\n    Person = \"foo\";\n  }\n}","collabId":"d674f525-ef92-4487-9172-c09e239cca39","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f3a920f9-6e09-471f-9ba3-9fc12a8c3a30","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面类的声明与下面的代码等价"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"0fb0b0fd-3334-49d3-8713-35ab7b4c65af","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9a7524fe-9832-45ec-8920-ff61f8ab9250","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 1. 类的声明不会提升到作用域的顶部\nlet Person = (function (o, properties) {\n  // 2. 在类内部的代码自动运行在严格模式 (strict mode) 之下\n  \"use strict\";\n\n  // 6. 在类中的方法中不能修改类名 (使用 const 定义)\n  const Person = function (name) {\n    // 5. 不使用 new 调用类会发生错误\n    if (typeof new.target === \"undefined\") {\n      throw new Error(\"Must be called by new\");\n    }\n    this.name = name;\n  };\n\n  Object.defineProperty(Person.prototype, \"sayHello\", {\n    value: function () {\n      // 4. 类中的方法都没有内置的 [[Construct]] 方法，所以当你 new 一个类内部的方法时，会抛出错误\n      if (typeof new.target !== \"undefined\") {\n        throw new Error(\"Method in class can't be called by new!\");\n      }\n      console.log(`Hello ${this.name}`);\n    },\n    // 3. 类中的方法都是不可枚举的\n    enumerable: false,\n    writable: false,\n    configurable: false,\n  });\n\n  return Person;\n})();","collabId":"ca3ccb33-d20b-4c6e-8a73-d20f33ab93e3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d218cfb8-446a-479c-9c75-6b514b648e1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类表达式的概念与函数表达式相对应"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"7948074a-341d-4ea0-a47e-da50326e1874","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"05b88bfb-c3c7-4b37-9dae-bff8ce418e35","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const Person = class {\n  constructor(name) {\n    this.name = name;\n  }\n  sayHello() {\n    console.log(`Hello ${this.name}`);\n  }\n};","collabId":"a925d032-b2f9-45cb-affa-99fde8b01a0a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"7d73d974-eee2-454e-a3cf-97a15c3e1a6d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"71fc7343-61b2-4134-b7b9-c9252a86a75e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类与函数一样，都是一等公民，即可以作为参数传入函数，也可以作为返回值返回。"}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/类"],"createTime":1692111582098,"updateTime":1744184171612,"linkedCards":[{"id":277,"target":{"key":"card:277","type":"card","id":277},"summary":"可以在类中定义访问器属性 class Person { constructor(name) { this._name = name; } set name(value) { if (typeof value === \"string\") { ...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]},{"id":278,"target":{"key":"card:278","type":"card","id":278},"summary":"与对象一样，可以为类中的方法名设置计算属性名 const methodName = \"sayHello\"; class Person { constructor(name) { this.name = name; } // 计算属性名 [m...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]},{"id":279,"target":{"key":"card:279","type":"card","id":279},"summary":"类中的方法可以是一个生成器 class Person { *generateNames() { yield \"Amy\"; yield \"Bob\"; yield \"Candy\"; } } let person = new Person(); ...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]},{"id":280,"target":{"key":"card:280","type":"card","id":280},"summary":"只可以通过类名访问的方法称为静态方法，在 class 定义的类中，通过在方法名前加 static 关键字表示该方法是静态方法 class Person { constructor(name) { this.name = name; } st...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]},{"id":281,"target":{"key":"card:281","type":"card","id":281},"summary":"通过关键字 extends 即可来继承一个类，继承自其它类的类称为子类，或者派生类。在子类的构造方法 constructor 中， 必须首先通过调用 super 方法来调用父类的构造函数 ，它会在这里初始化 this ，如果没有调用 sup...","tags":["JavaScript/类"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744184171612}}